[83.091, "o", "\r\n\ud83d\udd0d ARD Discovery Results for: 'how to design zero trust security and optimize analytical sql' (Found: 10)\r\n================================================================================\r\n1. Google Cloud Well-Architected Security Skill (Score: 100) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-security\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: Zero-trust architecture patterns, IAM privilege minimization, network security perimeters, and data encryption practices.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/security/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n2. BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines Skill (Score: 100) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering strategies, window functions, and schema design for analytical queries.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/bigquery/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n3. Cloud SQL, AlloyDB & Spanner Database Design Skill (Score: 81) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:database-design\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: Relational schema normalization, global Spanner key design, AlloyDB columnar engine tuning, and migration patterns.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/databases/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n4. Firebase Architecture & Security Rules Skill (Score: 81) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:firebase-architecture\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: Firestore document modeling, real-time sync patterns, Cloud Functions triggers, and declarative security rules.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/firebase/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n5. Google Cloud Well-Architected Reliability Skill (Score: 20) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-reliability\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: High availability, disaster recovery, circuit breakers, multi-region failover, and SLO/SRE best practices.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/reliability/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n6. Google Cloud Well-Architected Cost Optimization Skill (Score: 20) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-cost-optimization\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: FinOps best practices, compute autoscaling, storage lifecycle tiering, and cloud resource cost reduction strategies.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/cost-optimization/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n7. Google Cloud Well-Architected Operational Excellence Skill (Score: 20) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-operational-excellence\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: Infrastructure as Code (IaC), automated release management, blameless postmortems, and observability runbooks.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/operations/SKILL.md\r\n 