[149.39, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[151.01, "o", "\r\n\ud83d\udd0d ARD Discovery Results for: 'query bigquery dataset' (Found: 10)\r\n================================================================================\r\n1. BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines Skill (Score: 100) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering strategies, window functions, and schema design for analytical queries.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/bigquery/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n2. Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server (Score: 85) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [NEEDS_ONBOARDING]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Execute SQL queries, inspect table schemas, explore public datasets, and analyze analytical data directly through BigQuery.\r\n   URL:  https://bigquery.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Requires GCP auth (`gcloud auth application-default login`). Fallback: `urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines`.\r\n   \ud83d\ude80 Onboarding: Requires GCP credentials. Run `gcloud auth application-default login` or activate free tier.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n3. Google Cloud Well-Architected Cost Optimization Skill (Score: 60) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-cost-optimization\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: FinOps best practices, compute autoscaling, storage lifecycle tiering, and cloud resource cost reduction strategies.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/cost-optimization/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n4. Google Developer Knowledge MCP Server (Score: 26) [Tier 1: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:developer-knowledge\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Direct documentation search, API reference lookups, code samples, and troubleshooting across Google Cloud & developer documentation.\r\n   URL:  https://developer-knowledge.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Public endpoint or API key active.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n5. Google Cloud Resource Manager (gcloud) MCP Server (Score: 21) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [NEEDS_ONBOARDING]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:gcloud\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Manage GCP projects, enable APIs, query billing accounts, and orchestrate Cloud IAM policies.\r\n   URL:  https://resourcemanager.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Requires GCP auth (`gcloud auth application-default login`). \r\n   \ud83d\ude80 Onboarding: Requires GCP credentials. Run `gcloud auth application-default login` or activate free tier.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n6. Google Cloud SQL Managed MCP Server (Score: 10) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [NEEDS_ONBOARDING]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:cloud-sql\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Manage, connect to, and query PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQL Server managed database instances in Google Cloud.\r\n   URL:  https://cloudsql.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Requires GCP auth (`gcloud auth application-default login`). Fallback: `urn:ai:google.com:skills:database-design`.\r\n   \ud83d\ude80 Onboarding: Requires GCP credentials. Run `gcloud auth application-default login` or activate free tier.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n7. Google AlloyDB for PostgreSQL Managed MCP Server (Score: 10) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [NEEDS_ONBOARDING]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:alloydb\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: High-performance enterprise PostgreSQL database management, columnar engine queries, and cluster scaling.\r\n   URL:  https://alloydb.mcp.google.com/server."]
[151.01, "o", "json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Requires GCP auth (`gcloud auth application-default login`). Fallback: `urn:ai:google.com:skills:database-design`.\r\n   \ud83d\ude80 Onboarding: Requires GCP credentials. Run `gcloud auth application-default login` or activate free tier.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n8. Google Cloud Spanner Managed MCP Server (Score: 10) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [NEEDS_ONBOARDING]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:spanner\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Globally distributed ACID SQL database management, schema alteration, and high-concurrency analytical querying.\r\n   URL:  https://spanner.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Requires GCP auth (`gcloud auth application-default login`). Fallback: `urn:ai:google.com:skills:database-design`.\r\n   \ud83d\ude80 Onboarding: Requires GCP credentials. Run `gcloud auth application-default login` or activate free tier.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n9. Google Security Operations (SecOps) MCP Server (Score: 10) [Tier 4: GCP_ADC] [NEEDS_ONBOARDING]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:secops\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Investigate security alerts, search Chronicle UDM events, run threat intelligence queries, and orchestrate incident response.\r\n   URL:  https://secops.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Requires GCP auth (`gcloud auth application-default login`). Fallback: `urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-security`.\r\n   \ud83d\ude80 Onboarding: Requires GCP credentials. Run `gcloud auth application-default login` or activate free tier.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n10. Google Cloud Logging & Monitoring MCP Server (Score: 10) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [NEEDS_ONBOARDING]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:cloud-logging\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Query structured application and system logs, analyze error stacktraces, inspect metric dashboards, and check alerting policies.\r\n   URL:  https://logging.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Requires GCP auth (`gcloud auth application-default login`). \r\n   \ud83d\ude80 Onboarding: Requires GCP credentials. Run `gcloud auth application-default login` or activate free tier.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
