[181.433, "o", "\r\n\ud83d\udd0d ARD Discovery Results for: 'inspect cloud storage bucket and run bigquery' (Found: 10)\r\n================================================================================\r\n1. Google Cloud Well-Architected Cost Optimization Skill (Score: 100) [Tier 0: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-cost-optimization\r\n   Type: application/ai-skill\r\n   Desc: FinOps best practices, compute autoscaling, storage lifecycle tiering, and cloud resource cost reduction strategies.\r\n   URL:  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/cost-optimization/SKILL.md\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Ready for immediate offline/local execution.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n2. Google Cloud Storage (GCS) Managed MCP Server (Score: 100) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:cloud-storage\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Inspect buckets, list objects, upload and download files, manage storage permissions, and explore object metadata.\r\n   URL:  https://storage.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: GCP authenticated (service_account). Ready to execute.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n3. Google Cloud SQL Managed MCP Server (Score: 64) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:cloud-sql\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Manage, connect to, and query PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQL Server managed database instances in Google Cloud.\r\n   URL:  https://cloudsql.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: GCP authenticated (service_account). Ready to execute.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n4. Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server (Score: 60) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Execute SQL queries, inspect table schemas, explore public datasets, and analyze analytical data directly through BigQuery.\r\n   URL:  https://bigquery.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: GCP authenticated (service_account). Ready to execute.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n5. Google Cloud Run Managed MCP Server (Score: 52) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:cloud-run\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Deploy, inspect, scale, and monitor serverless container services and batch jobs on Cloud Run.\r\n   URL:  https://run.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: GCP authenticated (service_account). Ready to execute.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n6. Google Developer Knowledge MCP Server (Score: 45) [Tier 1: NONE] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:developer-knowledge\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Direct documentation search, API reference lookups, code samples, and troubleshooting across Google Cloud & developer documentation.\r\n   URL:  https://developer-knowledge.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: Public endpoint or API key active.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n7. Google Cloud Logging & Monitoring MCP Server (Score: 44) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:cloud-logging\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Query structured application and system logs, analyze error stacktraces, inspect metric dashboards, and check alerting policies.\r\n   URL:  https://logging.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: GCP authenticated (service_account). Ready to execute.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n8. Google Cloud Pub/Sub Managed MCP Server (Score: 36) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:pubsub\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Publish and subscribe to asynchronous event streams, manage topics and subscriptions, and inspect dead-letter queues.\r\n   URL:  https://pubsub.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n  "]
[181.434, "o", " \ud83d\udca1 Action: GCP authenticated (service_account). Ready to execute.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n9. Google Cloud Resource Manager (gcloud) MCP Server (Score: 36) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:gcloud\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Manage GCP projects, enable APIs, query billing accounts, and orchestrate Cloud IAM policies.\r\n   URL:  https://resourcemanager.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: GCP authenticated (service_account). Ready to execute.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n10. Google Cloud Spanner Managed MCP Server (Score: 28) [Tier 3: GCP_ADC] [READY]\r\n   ID:   urn:ai:google.com:mcp:spanner\r\n   Type: application/mcp-server-card+json\r\n   Desc: Globally distributed ACID SQL database management, schema alteration, and high-concurrency analytical querying.\r\n   URL:  https://spanner.mcp.google.com/server.json\r\n   \ud83d\udca1 Action: GCP authenticated (service_account). Ready to execute.\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
